        "collapsible-row-1": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Directions",
            "icon": "washing",
            "content": "<p>1/2 oz light soiled / small load<br/>1 oz activewear / medium load<br/>2 oz heavy soiled / large load </p><p>With our highly concentrated active ingredients, we do NOT recommend overfilling your laundry tub with clothes.  It is best to work with a medium size load and about 1 oz of detergent.  This way your laundry tumbles/swishes around in the tub and gets plenty of water and detergent on all the garments to ensure proper cleaning.</p><p>If you have lots of bubbles in your washing machine, decrease how much detergent you use.<br/><br/>If you have hard water use our <a href=\"/products/oxyboost-stain-remover\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Oxy Boost Stain Remover\">Oxyboost</a> to help soften the water so the detergent can work more efficiently.<br/><br/>Septic and graywater safe.</p><p><strong>When to use Hot Water<br/></strong>Hot water is good for whites, typical dirty clothes, sweaty active wear and diapers.  Hot water is best to remove germs, kill dust mites and heavily soiled items.</p><p><strong>When to use Warm Water</strong><br/>Warm water  is good for cleaning most man-made fibers, knits and jeans.  It will clean without fading or significant shrinking.</p><p><strong>When to use Cold Water</strong><br/>Cold water is best for dark, bright colors that bleed or delicate fabrics.  Pre-treat or pre-soak your clothes if items are heavily soiled.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible-row-0": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Ingredients",
            "icon": "plant",
            "content": "<p>High-purity water, cocamidopropyl betaine, cocamidopropyl hydroxysultaine, sodium C14-16 olefin sulfonate, coco-glucoside, vegetable glycerin, sodium citrate, phenoxyethanol, caprylyl glycol, polysorbate 20 (food-grade), caprylyl capryl glucoside, dimethyl 9-decenamide, sodium gluconate, citric acid</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible-row-2": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Scent",
            "icon": "leaf",
            "content": "<p><em>Seasonal Scent ingredients can be found within the product description. </em></p><p><em>All Rustic Strength Scents are made from:</em></p><p><strong>Pure essential oils</strong> • hand selected by us from small farms all around the world.</p><p><em>and/or</em></p><p><strong>Phthalate-free fragrance oils</strong> • aromatic compounds made of GRAS safe synthetics. Certified free of the 624 carcinogens and 323 reproductive/developmental toxins listed under the <a href=\"https://oehha.ca.gov/proposition-65/proposition-65-list\" target=\"_blank\">Prop 65 act</a>.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_AMpBQF": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Ingredient Descriptions",
            "icon": "eye",
            "content": "<p><a href=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/charcoal-filtered-deionized-water\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/charcoal-filtered-deionized-water\"><strong>High-Purity Water </strong></a>(charcoal-filtered, reverse osmosis, UV-sanitized)</p><p><a href=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/cocamidopropyl-betaine-in-household-cleaning-products-and-personal-care-items-what-you-need-to-know\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/cocamidopropyl-betaine-in-household-cleaning-products-and-personal-care-items-what-you-need-to-know\"><strong>Cocamidopropyl Betaine</strong></a><strong> (</strong>Naturally derived from coconut and palm-free. It is an environmentally friendly, high-foaming, and biodegradable surfactant.)</p><p><a href=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/what-is-cocamidopropyl-hydroxysultaine-sultaine-and-what-does-it-do-in-products\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/what-is-cocamidopropyl-hydroxysultaine-sultaine-and-what-does-it-do-in-products\"><strong>Cocamidopropyl Hydroxysultaine </strong></a>(Naturally derived from coconut, palm-free, it is an environmentally friendly and biodegradable surfactant with high foaming and mild chemistry.)</p><p><a href=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/what-is-sodium-c14-16-alpha-olefin-sulfonate-aos-40-and-what-does-it-do\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Sodium C14-C16 Olefin Sulfonate </strong></a>(Derived from coconuts, palm-free, this mild-surfactant helps to lift dirt and debris from surfaces, so the water can whisk them away. Biodegradable. )</p><p><a href=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/what-is-coco-glucoside-and-what-does-it-do-in-products\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/what-is-coco-glucoside-and-what-does-it-do-in-products\"><strong>Coco-Glucoside </strong></a>(A plant-derived, biodegradable surfactant. It is mild and safe for sensitive skin.)</p><p><a href=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/what-is-glycerin-and-what-does-it-do-in-products?_pos=1&_sid=873f11cd7&_ss=r\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Vegetable Glycerin</strong></a> (Derived from vegetables. It is biodegradable and helps the plant surfactants do their job. Food-grade & USP kosher.)</p><p><strong>Sodium Citrate (</strong>Natural mineral, helps grab onto and remove pollutants.)</p><p><strong>Caprylyl Glycol, </strong><a href=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/phenoxyethanol-in-personal-care-products-what-you-need-to-know\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/phenoxyethanol-in-personal-care-products-what-you-need-to-know\"><strong>Phenoxyethanol</strong></a><strong> (</strong>Safe preservatives used sparingly, prevents bacteria from growing in container.)</p><p><a href=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/what-is-polysorbate-20-and-what-does-it-do-in-products\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/what-is-polysorbate-20-and-what-does-it-do-in-products\"><strong>Polysorbate 20 </strong></a>(Plant-based performance stabilizer. Helps in the spreadability of liquids and stabilizes the formula when adding essential oils and phthalate-free fragrances. <em>Biodegradable. USP kosher. Food-Grade. Dioxane-free. )</em></p><p> <a href=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/what-is-caprylyl-capryl-glucoside-and-what-does-it-do-in-products?_pos=1&_sid=c51e07020&_ss=r\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Caprylyl Capryl Glucoside </strong></a>(A biodegradable plant-based surfactant with mild chemistry and sensitive skin compatibility.)</p><p><a href=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/what-is-dimethyl-9-decenamide-and-what-does-it-do?_pos=1&_sid=cc46b9ea9&_ss=r\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Dimethyl 9-Decenamide </strong></a>(A plant-based, biodegradable nonionic surfactant that helps clean and removes grease and other substances.)</p><p><a href=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/what-is-sodium-gluconate\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/what-is-sodium-gluconate\"><strong>Sodium Gluconate</strong></a><strong> (</strong>Natural mineral, helps grab onto and remove foreign contaminants.)</p><p><a href=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/what-is-citric-acid-and-what-does-it-do-in-products\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/what-is-citric-acid-and-what-does-it-do-in-products\"><strong>Citric Acid</strong></a> (balances pH)</p><p><a href=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/what-are-essential-oils\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/what-are-essential-oils\"><strong>Essential Oil</strong></a>and/or<a href=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/what-are-fragrance-oils\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/ingredients/what-are-fragrance-oils\"><strong>Phthalate-Free Fragrance Oil </strong></a>(scent, if scented)</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_Yb8A7e": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Laundry Tips",
            "icon": "question_mark",
            "content": "<p><strong>Stain removal.</strong> Simply place a little detergent directly on the stain and scrub the fabric together. &nbsp;Some stains respond better with cold-water vs hot water. &nbsp;For more details on a specific stain removal, please see our helpful <a href=\"https://rusticstrength.com/blogs/tips-tricks/stain-removal-tips?ref=wholesale&utm_source=wholesale&utm_medium=referral\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Stain Removal Guide blog\">Stain Removal Blogs.</a></p><p>Remove the toughest stains with&nbsp;<a href=\"/products/oxyboost-stain-remover\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Oxy Boost Stain Remover\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Oxy Boost</strong></span>&nbsp;</a>and&nbsp;<a href=\"/products/un-bleach\" title=\"Un-Bleach\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Un-Bleach</strong></span></a>.&nbsp;</p><p>Soften hard water and clean with&nbsp;<a href=\"/products/epic-washing-soda\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Epic Washing Soda\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Epic Washing Soda</strong></span></a>.&nbsp;</p><p>Soften fabrics and remove odors with&nbsp;<a href=\"/collections/fabric-softener\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"fabric softener\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Fabric Softener</strong></span></a>.&nbsp;</p><p>Remove wrinkles and static with&nbsp;<a href=\"/collections/dryer-balls-sheets\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"dryer balls\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>US Sourced Dyer Balls</strong></span></a>.&nbsp;</p><p>Dilute our&nbsp;<a href=\"/collections/castile-soap\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"castile soap\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Castile Soap</strong></span></a>&nbsp;with distilled water for a re-useable baby wipe solution.&nbsp;</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_XqjUrW": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Does this product come with a pump?",
            "icon": "question_mark",
            "content": "<p>We do not automatically provide a pump or spout with our products because our goal is to reduce waste.</p><p>If you would like a pump or spout, we offer options as an add-on in our accessory section. </p><ul><li><a href=\"/products/1-gallon-glass-or-plastic-container-pump\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Pump | fits 1 Gallon Glass or Plastic Jug\">Gallon (Glass or Plastic) Jug Pump</a></li><li><a href=\"/pages/how-to-assemble-the-wide-mouth-jar-pump\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Wide-Mouth Jar Pump Help\">1 Gallon Wide Mouth Jar Pump</a></li><li><a href=\"/pages/eco-jug-help\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Eco-Jug Help\">Eco Jug Accessories</a></li><li><a href=\"/products/bucket-dispenser-pump-5-gallon\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Bucket Pump | fits 5 Gallon Bucket\">Bucket Pump</a></li><li><a href=\"/collections/drum-pumps\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"drum pumps\">Drum Pumps</a></li></ul><p><strong>Retail Ready Case (2 oz, 4 oz & 16 oz) : </strong>Retail Ready products come as shown in the case image. Pump, Sprayer or Flip-Top Cap is included if shown.</p><p>No pump is available for the <strong>24 oz Glass Jug</strong>. </p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
